{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37F020","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，我们的Metal Gear<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，\n已经装上AI Pod了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"调整AI花了不少功夫，不过多亏Strangelove\n博士，总算处理好了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那个博士？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"怎么了，Snake？没什么好惊讶的吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……这样真的好吗？我们是“无国界之师”。\n需要足以遏制国家干涉的力量。\n那就是<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>。必要时……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":148,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我并没有否定威慑力本身。\n问题在于国家依赖威慑力。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"一旦国家依赖威慑力，本应由国民共同组成的国家\n这个组织，就会开始强迫国民作出牺牲。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":122,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"说到底，国家这种存在本身就对人类有害。\n所以我在不属于任何国家的MSF身上\n看到了可能性。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过，要让你们与国家保持距离，\n终究还是需要力量吧。\n为此，我愿意尽力协助。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……那真是帮大忙了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"另外，我终究只是帮了Huey的忙。\n我没打算给<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>装上像“她”那样的AI。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"嗯。这样就好。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":22,"review_flag":""}]}